    "text": "<p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> be any poistive real number.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></munder><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>It is given that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, by using Sandwich theorem,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
